<title>FINLAND: HELASTO 12-MTH PROFIT FALLS 10 PCT.</title>
<headline>HELASTO 12-MTH PROFIT FALLS 10 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to October 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, tax	    7.1 vs 7.9</p>
<p> Net sales					  102.4 vs 93.2</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	10.4 vs 11.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish security device manufacturer is</p>
<p>Suomen Helasto Oy. The company will release its full financial</p>
<p>statement on January 9.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
